{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"The avatar is the two-colour block: keys 1 and 3 move it up and left by one tile; keys 2 and 4 are blocked at the entry. Visibility follows it, and a bottom bar shrinks even on blocked moves. I’ll test the nearby ring-shaped objects to see whether they replenish that bar."}}
